### =========================
### GATEWAY – HEALTH CHECK
### =========================
GET http://localhost:5002/actuator/health
Accept: application/json


### =========================
### EXERCISE – LIST / TEST
### (przechodzi przez gateway)
### =========================
GET http://localhost:5002/api/exercise
Accept: application/json


### =========================
### EXERCISE – GET BY ID
### =========================
GET http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/1
Accept: application/json


### =========================
### EXERCISE – CREATE (POST)
### =========================
POST http://localhost:5002/api/exercise
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test exercise",
  "description": "Exercise created via API Gateway",
  "difficulty": "EASY"
}


### =========================
### EXERCISE RESULT – LIST FOR EXERCISE
### (ważna ścieżka z * w gatewayu)
### =========================
GET http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/1/result
Accept: application/json


### =========================
### EXERCISE RESULT – CREATE
### =========================
POST http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/1/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 42,
  "score": 95,
  "durationSeconds": 123
}


### =========================
### BEZPOŚREDNIO (DEBUG) – EXERCISE
### omija gateway
### =========================
GET http://localhost:5000/api/exercise
Accept: application/json


### =========================
### BEZPOŚREDNIO (DEBUG) – EXERCISE RESULT
### =========================
GET http://localhost:5010/api/exercise/1/result
Accept: application/json